s","/farmland-atlas/colorado/morgan-county"],["ARC or PLC in Morgan County","/arc-plc/colorado/morgan-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids. February to March came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those years, more than any other pair. This year started thin on the middle of the grids, with January to February at 28% of normal in 2026 and April to May at 56% in 2026. Grid 24106 had its driest year in 2002 at 48% of normal.</p>"}
